{"id": null, "n": "0357007", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0357007", "type": "mod", "text": "若加用幣帛用普供養明【大】，若加用幣帛用普供養明【乙】"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "若加用幣帛用普供養明"}
{"id": null, "n": "0357008", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0357008", "type": "mod", "text": "明【大】，真言【乙】"}
